    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Amounts owed for unpaid installments or fees when a policy is reinstated. Induced from a Hierarchy placement via graph-native parent (entity role co-occurrence): subClassOf CONCEPT; cluster of 2 surface variant(s) merged…</rdfs:comment>
