    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has Coverage Limit</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Indicates the maximum amount of coverage provided for a specific insured event or liability under an insurance policy. Assigned domain=Coverage, range=CoverageLimit; The property defines the maximum coverage amount for a…</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Indicates the maximum amount of coverage provided for a specific insured event or liability under an insurance policy.</skos:definition>
