    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A policy provision excluding coverage for death resulting from military service in a war zone. Induced from a Hierarchy placement via graph-native parent (entity role co-occurrence): subClassOf CONCEPT; cluster of 3 surf…</rdfs:comment>
