    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Deducted On</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Represents the act or instance of a deduction applied within an insurance contract. Assigned domain=Deduction, range=AccountValue; The property 'deduction' refers to the application of a charge or reduction within an ins…</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Represents the act or instance of a deduction applied within an insurance contract.</skos:definition>
