    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Surrender charge applies within first 12 years. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence confirms a surrender charge is applied within the first 12 years, and the charge is quantified as a monetary value.…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Eligibility for coverage after employment termination. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence states that employees may port their coverage as an individual policy after leaving employment, indicating co…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policyholder must apply for portability before a deadline. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence specifies a time limit (31 days) for portability application, indicating a temporal constraint. The prope…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policyholder must meet criteria to qualify for a split option. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The sentences indicate conditions (survival of both insureds, evidence of insurability) for exercising the split o…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Future children are automatically covered under the policy. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The policy automatically extends coverage to future children, indicating the existence of a coverage instance. The pr…</rdfs:comment>
